# Armasaur Guide: two attackers are not three (CR 603.2). Bot1 attacks with the Guide and Memnite only: nothing triggers (no
# target is asked for, the stack is empty and no creature has a counter), and the 4 + 1 combat damage takes Bot2 from 20 to 15. The
# Ornithopter stays home.

